          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            We identify the specific brand and model to understand its lock system before attempting entry. Common gun safe brands we service include Liberty, Stack-On, Winchester, Browning, Fort Knox, Cannon, and Hornady.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            We confirm ownership before opening any firearms safe â€” please have identification and purchase documentation available if possible. All service is handled professionally and with complete discretion.
          </p>
