          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Common causes include forgotten combinations in older dial safes, forgotten PIN codes in digital models, and slight warping of the door from the heat-resistant liner materials over time. We handle all of these scenarios and can open most consumer-grade fireproof safes without damage.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            After opening, we advise on combination reset or lock servicing. If the lock has significantly deteriorated, we can replace it with a new mechanism to keep the safe functional for continued document protection.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 5 -->
